# Model artifacts. Most of motor_output/ is enormous and regenerable, so only the
# irreplaceable, small parts are versioned: the banked prediction bundles every
# downstream analysis re-reads, the run logs and manifests, the comparison tables
# and the figures.
#
# NO CHECKPOINT OF ANY KIND IS VERSIONED (changed 2026-09-08). Every *.pt under
# runs/ was stripped from git history with git-filter-repo -- full fine-tune
# checkpoints at 517 MB apiece and LoRA adapters at 3-13 MB alike -- because the
# 425 of them in history had grown .git to 3.3 GB. They remain on local disk and
# are the ONLY copy: back them up outside the repo. Every selection/*.npz stays
# versioned, so any pairing or diversity analysis is still reproducible from a
# clone with no GPU pass.
motor_output/runs/*/*.pt
motor_output/oracle_*.npz
motor_output/probe/
motor_output/probe-ng/
# XGBoost's QuantileDMatrix page cache -- 28 GB while a fit is in flight.
# run_train_baseline removes it on exit, but it exists during the run.
motor_output/runs/*/cache/
docs/
